+            <t indent="0" pn="section-3.4-2.2.1">This field is required if the value for the compression field
+has been set to 3.   The values are set as shown below for TIFF-
+F.   For TIFF-F, uncompressed data is not allowed and EOLs <bcp14>MAY</bcp14>
+be byte aligned (see section 3.8.3).
+bit 0 = 0 for 1-Dimensional, 1 for 2-Dimensional (MR)
